{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34266","headline":"五歌 雨夜 · 陆龟蒙","name":"五歌 雨夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屋小茅乾雨声大，自疑身着蓑衣卧。\n兼似孤舟小泊时，风吹折苇来相佐。\n我有愁襟无可那，才成好梦刚惊破。\n背壁残灯不及萤，重挑却向灯前坐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}